--- !u!114 &1384061914
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1384061913}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: We've got movement up top, the Coil's regrouping. Whatever's happening
      down there, happen faster.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You came to confirm a kill. Go back and report a man instead, or come down
      the rest of the way with us. I'm not putting a gun to it. They do that. I don't.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Mera Voss
    text: If I report this they'll send someone who won't hesitate the way I just
      did. I'd rather be on the side that hesitates. I'm in. I can read a trail no
      one else on your crew can.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Ally number two. And this one came to kill you. I'd say the day's improving.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then you berth aboard the Cairn with the rest of us. Everyone we take in
      lives on the ship.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Mera Voss
    text: A turned weapon and a smuggler and a salvage man's kid. All of you, holed
      up in a dead leviathan.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: She's coming up with you?
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: She's crew. She'll explain on the way. Leave Kerrax for the Coil to find.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: He'll tell it wrong. Let him. The woman behind you saw what really happened,
      and so did I. It was never a glitch, Cipher. That part's just you.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1012985874}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 836668433}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1384061915}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
