  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Tessa Rin
    text: You really aren't them. Fine. The data's real, it's Program disposal internals,
      and it's the last thing I'm ever selling. Take it.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: This is your termination record. The real one, not the manifest.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Hold on. This is wrong.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Wrong how.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Your killswitch didn't fail. I called it a fault after Velorum, a switch
      that misfired and quit. It didn't misfire. Somebody got inside the firmware
      and broke it on purpose.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: I told you it quit before it finished and I didn't know why. There's your
      why. I had a front-row seat to your execution, Cipher, and I missed that.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then it wasn't luck. Someone wanted me walking.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Who?
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: The record doesn't say. Whoever did it scrubbed themselves out of it cleaner
      than they scrubbed your switch. That takes someone high.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Tessa Rin
    text: And that's exactly why I'm not standing here while you talk about who in
      the Program has long arms. I was never in this aisle.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: Go to ground deep. If we found you in an afternoon, the Coil will too.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Pack it. The relay on the Mast is feeding the whole city my face. We trace
      it back to the man holding the leash.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  textMesh: {fileID: 716765953}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 263633077}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1856795928}
  billboardToCamera: 1
